Complete local Kotlin/JVM example; the app itself does not execute it:
```kotlin

fun clamp(value: Int): Int = value.coerceIn(0, 10)
fun main() {
    check(clamp(-1) == 0) { "lower boundary" }
    check(clamp(7) == 7) { "inside range" }
    check(clamp(11) == 10) { "upper boundary" }
    println("checks passed")
}
```

